    "body": "Renamed identity parameters previously produced the fixed spelling `value`. Add a learned bounded selector over retained word occurrences, causal byte-copy state and an optional suffix frame derived from the actual observed final copied byte. The parent occurrence reader, typed operators and lexical-entry parameters remain fixed. Old artifacts and their replay behavior are preserved.\n\nThe first copy fit selected all twelve correct transfer declarations but completed only two responses. The completed-word frame completes 12/12 with the same data, dictionary, 512 selector rows and initial decisions; suffix rows fall from 185 to 42. All twelve generated functions compile and pass 84 independent identity assertions. Full retains the original 32 responses, 24 numeric targets and eight binding outputs. The twenty original Rust source hashes match their prior passed execution receipts. The actual `r4 geometric generate` CLI reproduces the full saved `argument` Generation object.\n\nCopy-disabled completes 0/12 transfers. Copy-geometry-disabled still copies all twelve correct identifiers but fails every continuation. This is a combined within-artifact feature effect on OPEN development, not a matched refit or general capability claim. City transfers remain 0/2; learned lexical-prefix-to-copy composition is still missing. Ordinary decoding continues per byte and costs more on the four familiar `value` cases; no whole-model speedup is claimed.\n\nValidation: 102 native library tests before the suffix repair; final eleven copy/state tests, six allocation/source checks covering both suffix laws, five probe checks, earlier three context and twenty CLI/service tests; release CLI and probe built offline with pinned Rust 1.97.1. Final fmt, source architecture policy, claim-wording and diff checks pass. The final binary replays 104 original-entry and 146 first-copy Generation objects exactly. Two initial engineering failures and the first model's ten compiler failures remain recorded.\n\nResources: cumulative model work 947.062/1,800 seconds; retained-word engineering 1,545.328/1,800 seconds. Necessary +104 MiB storage increments were recorded under the owner's standing authorization, in addition to the inherited prior +40 MiB; no deletion or external compute. The source, controls, complete exposed cost counters, source/binary identities and local artifact paths are in `docs/native_geometric_word_copy_973.md` and its evidence JSON.\n\nContinues #973; does not close its broader qualification objective. Protected CI must be read by actual executed steps: the four compatibility acknowledgements do not constitute audit, fuzz, WASM or Gate C execution.\n",
